      "reason": "双方都 unknown 的设备/引擎身份仍不可比，不能把相同未知值视为同一实物。"
    },
    {
      "test": "test_interrupted_request_preserves_durable_partial_answer",
      "decision": "keep",
      "reason": "崩溃请求保留耐久部分答案但质量无 rate，避免丢失可审阅回答或误判完整。"
    },
    {
      "test": "test_missing_terminal_and_missing_score_reconstruction",
      "decision": "keep",
      "reason": "缺 terminal 还原 invalid，缺 score 仍保留 completed 分母并 unscorable，避免静默漏计。"
    },
    {
